	"FriendlyName": "HitTicker - Floating Damage Numbers, Pooled and Budgeted",
	"Description": "Thousands of floating damage numbers per second on a single canvas pass. No UUserWidget per hit, no allocation while the game runs: a fixed-size ring buffer, one draw pass per frame, a hard per-frame budget, screen-space overlap avoidance and same-target merging that turns thirty hits a second into one counting-up number. Styles are data assets, the numbers draw from AHUD or from a one-line call in your own HUD class, and the whole thing survives a cooked Shipping build.",
